
---
import BookLayout from "../../../layouts/BookLayout.astro";
---

<BookLayout title="Part 1 — Foundations">
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <header class="rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-950 to-indigo-800 p-8 text-white">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-blue-200">
        DATA TO CAREER · PART 01
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold">
        Foundations of Data Analytics
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-8 text-blue-100">
        Build a strong foundation in data, analytics, and problem-solving.
        Start your journey from understanding data to becoming a professional
        data and AI engineer.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Welcome to Part 1</h2>
      <p class="leading-8 text-gray-700">
        Every successful data professional begins with a clear understanding
        of data. Before learning advanced tools, programming, or artificial
        intelligence, you need to understand what data is, why it matters,
        and how organizations use it to make better decisions.
      </p>
      <p class="leading-8 text-gray-700">
        In this part, you will develop the essential knowledge required for
        your journey into Data Analytics and the wider world of data and AI.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-xl border p-6 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Chapter 1 — Introduction</h2>
      <p class="leading-7 text-gray-600">
        What is Data? Introduction to Data Analytics.
      </p>
      <a
        href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/part/foundations/chapter-01/`}
        class="inline-block rounded-lg bg-blue-700 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-800"
      >
        Start Chapter 1 →
      </a>
    </section>

    <section class="rounded-xl bg-gray-50 p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold">Your learning goals</h2>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-gray-700">
        <li>Understand the meaning and importance of data.</li>
        <li>Learn how data analytics supports business decisions.</li>
        <li>Develop analytical thinking and problem-solving skills.</li>
        <li>Prepare for more advanced data and AI topics.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </article>
</BookLayout>
